  "count_notes": [
    "Counts are complete-success planned operations and fixed output denominators, not receipts or resource ceilings. A failed slot consumes its one attempt; all dependency-not-entered rows remain.",
    "Per-host pipeline lifecycle: one no-VAE WanPipeline load, one encode_prompt call returning positive/negative embeddings, two fresh 50-step trajectories. Text encoder and DiT are components of that pipeline; prompt-pair API count does not claim a measured internal text-encoder forward count.",
    "Per-host VAE lifecycle: load once after generation pipeline release, retain for D3 and E72, release. Four total loads; not copied from the old E6-only notebook. Model downloads and internal kernels are not assigned fabricated counts.",
    "OFF truly no writer; P0 writer25 local updates; PM derives P0 with one gamma1 terminal construct. Native PM Q7744 is additional to receiver Q253440 per host. No full181 E, latent re-encode baseline, terminal payload rewrite, or DiT reuse/fork optimization.",
    "Writer FFT25 per host has full16x46 planes each and one autograd backward per update. Receiver FFT72 each covers4x10 planes. Backward internal FFT kernel count is not equated to one explicit inverse-FFT API. No DiT or tail backward.",
    "Nominal decoder chunks46 per D181 and encoder chunks11 per E41 are architecture expectations; future hooks report actual counts and concrete discrepancies without exact-version gates.",
    "24 reset origins per arm are all distinct; 72 physical E per host, 144 keyed tables, 36 query families. Each query has137 states; these are not independent null samples. FFT shared only between two keys on same E.",
    "All old score fields and reducers are retained for same-evidence forced-min reference and C-consensus inspection. They do not supply alternative decision rules. Group Counter occupancy per family: 62 for p0 starts1..35 plus3x61 for other phases, times8bits =1960.",
    "Candidate signed vote accesses count each use in seq; zero-mask accesses counted separately. Counter internal scans, tie bookkeeping, serialization, tensor movement and OS disk calls are not fabricated as extra physical experiments. Local raw Counter11520 per host is additional to group Counter70560.",
